{"id":"vod_jy_32622","vodId":"32622","provider":"jy","providerName":"金鹰资源","type":2,"name":"目隐都市的演绎者","name_cn":"目隐都市的演绎者","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日本动漫","remarks":"第12集","images":{"common":"https://image.jinyingimage.com/cover/9fd54dd7e4d3bff4807c83c241e2751c.jpg"},"summary":"目隐都市的演绎者》是《阳炎project》动画化《MekakuCity暂无内容Actors》的中文名称，于2014年4月12日播出的日本新番动画。暂无内容《阳炎project》（日语：カゲロウプロジェクト）是由音乐创作者、小说家jin（じん，自然之敌P）于2011年开始发表的多媒体项目创作。最早开始发表的是使用歌声合成技术VOCALOID技术制作的音乐，乐曲的主要风格是合成器摇滚，也制作类似于抒情曲的作品，经常会被打上\"惊异的中毒性\"的标签。每首曲子都讲述着一个故事，而每个故事都属于一个世界观，彼此间都有联系。故事，而每个故事都属于一个世界观，彼此间都有联系。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2024-06-14 16:10:04","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"jinyingm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/neg5ojGb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/vbmwxp9e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/zbqjB00d/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/7axGME3e/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/6dBgZJke/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/QdJZpgJd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/0dNxwADa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/PdRgAGOe/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/QbY6LPMd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/Le3l8DOa/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/xe76ZKyd/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://hd.kuktxu.com/play/neg5o4Gb/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T11:55:52.597Z"}